WEBVTT

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.090
Kei!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.930
Ingrid...

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.190
She's a tough one...

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.790
Ingrid! Are you okay?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.420
Yeah, somehow...

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.050
We can't hold out much longer...

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:04.130
Is that it? You survived
this long; hang in there!

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.810
Noa?! But why...?

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.680
Noa?

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.520
It's Sara and Tia's big sister.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:16.940
Really... So what's that?

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:21.650
You're the only ones left to play with me.
Come on, let's have some fun!

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.570
Johann!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:29.280
Oh, could you tell? I guess you guys
have known each other a long time!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.880
You're not even trying to hide it!

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.500
I guess not!

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:39.260
Listen, Ingrid! This one's a real naughty kid!

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:43.960
Just a second ago, she escaped
from my control and saved Tisis!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:47.140
She really is a naughty one.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:51.770
That's why I tied her down a little tighter.
She won't escape again.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.520
What have you done?

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.480
We'll be taking her back now, Johann.

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:59.730
I don't think you can, Ingrid.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.280
I spent 12 years with you two.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:07.450
We can look back on those times together...
As I slowly kill you.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.850
All right! We're back!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.810
Who are you?

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:42.820
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:45.660
If you're looking for Alecto,
it's over there, fading away.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:51.950
Rena!

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:19.480
If we could just deal with that reflector...

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:25.610
Unfortunately, Sara and Tia's
sister is in there, too...

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:29.450
Okay, why don't we talk about the Regalia first?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.630
Johann!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.340
Where is Noa?!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.720
Where is she?!

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:52.430
Your sister has gone to
finish off that pesky Ingrid.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.390
Sara! Tia!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:02.070
--Yui!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.480
We'll be okay...

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.910
You guys have to go save Ingrid and Kei...

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.490
And your sister!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.990
Yui...

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:19.620
Tia!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.830
Okay!

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:31.220
Avenger of malefactors,
eradicating darkness and upholding the light...

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:37.010
May the damning sins that dwell
within us be reflected in your blade!

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:41.400
Release your unclouded brilliance,
thunderous sacred relics!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.610
In the name of Erinius, reveal yourself!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.790
Aurea Tisis.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:12.010
We'll be back! Don't you go dying on us, Yui!

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:13.550
Don't you die on us!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.820
So what makes you think you're "okay"?

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.670
How much do you know about the Regalia?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:50.720
They are divine vessels that let one
use the otherworldly power of Lux.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.840
Kei!

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:55.300
We've got to stall and keep
looking for an opportunity.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:08:00.010
Correct. But there was one big
problem with those divine vessels.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:06.850
In order for the Regalia to accept
Lux's power, a sacrifice was necessary.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.240
Like you.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:15.740
Sadly, those who were
sacrificed could not withstand

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:20.450
Lux's limitless power, nor could
they go back to being human.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:25.000
They were destined to fade away
as the monsters they had become.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.640
Rena! Rena!

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.680
Answer me! Rena!

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.390
Rena...

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.730
It's pointless.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:50.570
Your sister will never go back
to her original form again.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.780
It's your fault.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.620
It's your fault that she ended up this way.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.190
We're sacrifices for the Regalia?

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:35.400
Yes. That's why humans tried to invent
new ones to replace the flawed Regalia.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:41.370
A new divine receptacle
that did not need sacrifices.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.160
And that became Lux Ex Machina.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.920
You protect Rena. You protect your people.
You protect your country.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:57.630
How very noble of you.
You may get full marks as an Empress...

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:02.890
But your sister continued to use power...

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.020
Listen now, there's more to tell.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:35.290
You once asked me if I didn't
have someone I cared about.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:37.420
You don't mean...

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.550
I've found someone that I care about.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:46.470
All of the souls on this planet
are now my precious dolls.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.980
Why are you doing this?!

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:56.780
There's no reason. I just wanted
to see the look on your face

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:00.360
when you realized you had lost
everyone that is dear to you.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.580
Ingrid and the others will be dead soon.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:11.240
Everyone you care about belongs to me now.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:16.040
You will live in darkness, alone, forever.
You will lose all hope.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.760
Yuinshiel Asteria.

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:01.260
Ingrid! Kei!

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:07.760
Sara? Tia?!

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:08.760
Sorry we're late!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.270
Yui's here, too!

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:17.980
Lux Ex Machina... A new divine
vessel made by people...

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:19.940
What does it want with humans?

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:24.070
This new divine vessel has
decided to take humans souls

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:27.910
and remake the world.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:32.290
And in this new world,
free of aging and illness,

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:37.000
the souls taken by Lux Ex Machina,
like Noa, will become my toys!

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:45.470
Shut up! Get out of Noa!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:46.930
Get out!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.260
We're going to save Noa and return
home with Yui and everyone else!

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.480
There's no saving Alecto.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.730
Or the Empress.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:01.150
Yui and Rena are... No! It can't be!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:05.860
You saw for yourself what happens
to a Regalia that's used all its power.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:16.370
Don't worry. You'll join them soon.
I'll see to that.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.210
Don't say that...

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:25.970
Not in her voice!

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:44.070
Mom... Dad...

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.610
Don't cry, Yui.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.500
Come back... Mom! Dad!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.440
Yui...

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:23.650
Huh?

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:24.860
What?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.740
What's going on?!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.830
Those three Regalia Gear
can switch places instantly.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:39.080
We've got to save Noa
and get back to Yui, quick!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.620
What'll we do?!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.170
Calm down, you two.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:46.260
If all three of them can switch,
we don't stand a chance.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.800
Let's try to take out one of them to start.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.640
Okay, Tia and I will try to handle Noa!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.260
Yeah!

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:57.970
Noa's help allowed us to get back to Yui.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.560
Now it's our turn to help her!

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:05.070
We'll take our sister back
from Johann, once again!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:09.770
Sara, Tia, I'm sorry. Please let
us handle your sister for a bit.

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.030
--Huh?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:15.120
While we're doing that, I want you
to prepare a really big attack!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:15.950
But--

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.870
It's okay! Trust us!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.630
Okay!

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.260
In the name of Erinius,
Tisis will slice through!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:48.610
Yui.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.950
Big sis...

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.160
Thank you for coming, Yui.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:01.160
Let's go. Everyone is waiting.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.290
Yui?

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.420
Let's stay together, big sis.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.920
What's wrong, Yui?

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:15.300
You're stuck as Alecto, aren't you?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.660
Shield?

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:45.660
There's an important toy in the orbis.
It won't break that easily.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.130
That means...

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.210
The souls trapped in there...

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.430
You're right.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:03.010
I probably won't be able to
return to my human form.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:07.980
Then I don't care! I'd rather
stay here with you, forever!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:09.860
Yui...

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.860
Don't you want to stay here, too?

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.780
I'm not sure I feel that way...

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:16.990
Huh?

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:32.750
Ugh! What a pain!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:35.510
Ingrid, do you mind if I go a little overboard?

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.720
Of course not.

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:39.930
Thanks!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:57.240
You know, I've always thought
you were really amazing.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:58.910
There's nothing amazing about me--

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.620
You're really a crybaby.
You just want to play with your friends.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:10.630
You miss your mother and father
so much, you can't stand it.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.880
And yet, you persevere.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.880
It's because you're with me.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:20.590
I know. I worked hard at being the
big sister of my amazing little sister.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.100
Big sis...

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.350
That's why I know what you want to do.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.560
Huh?

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.230
Because I'm your sister.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.930
Thunderous light, rending the netherworld!

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:18.150
You came to get back what
Johann took away, didn't you?

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:22.030
But I had nothing to say back to him.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.740
Yeah. I couldn't do anything by myself, either.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.160
And yet...

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:34.750
Yui, do you remember your promise to Mother?

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.340
To work together?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:44.550
We are her daughters and she is proud of us.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.050
Yeah.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.180
She doesn't lie.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:50.390
Right.

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:59.030
I might not be able to do anything alone...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.820
But together... maybe we can do something.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:30.970
Sara, Tia!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.400
Dwelling in many blades,
become the brilliant light

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.320
that dispels impeding darkness!

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:51.030
Rena... What will happen to us if we die?

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:54.750
I don't know. But...

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:56.170
But?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:21:00.880
When I thought I might die alone,
I was really scared.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.760
But I don't feel that way anymore.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:04.930
Huh?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.430
Because even if I die, you'll be by my side.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.970
Big sis...

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:17.770
Who is that?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:20.650
I think she's me.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:24.440
Another me, born from Alecto.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.860
So, you gave her your ring?

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:32.330
Yeah. I think that's what
allowed me to see you again.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.160
I see. Thank you.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:42.380
It's not over yet. Kei, Tia,
and the others are still fighting.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.880
Let's go, Yui.

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.970
Okay, big sis!
